{"version":1,"key":"card:15","content":{"id":15,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"TypeScript 内置了三个类型：","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"any","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"unknown","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"never","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4758b031-19c1-45a1-8359-31aa2928a5e5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"any","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示任意类型，一个变量如果标注为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"any","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 类型，那么它可以接受任何类型的赋值，也可以赋值为任何的类型","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2f9fc649-7692-4e5b-a66f-3ca81ff50e9a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"let s: any = \"Hello World!\";\n// 可以赋值为 number 类型的变量\nconst n: number = s;\n// 可以接受任意类型的赋值\ns = 123;\n\n\n// 因为标注为 any，所以编译时不会报错，在运行时问题才暴露出来\ns.bar();","collabId":"e94a2bea-1e23-4d01-85b7-365dbe7572fa","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"2eabfb60-2595-40c8-b5d9-7f1c153ddb5c","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"639b4715-3fca-4a14-9391-584dd30cfa4b"},{"children":[{"text":"由此可见，将变量标注为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"any","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 类型与写 JavaScript 没什么两样，TypeScript 的类型系统也就失去了意义，一般我们不知道一个变量类型或者类型太复杂的时候我们会标记为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"any","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，但是还是少用，否则 TypeScript 就变为了 AnyScript。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"180175e6-f058-484e-8f0c-4bced40a2b1b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"当我们声明变量时没有标注类型，会被隐式的推导为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"any","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 类型。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"06112f99-1a9d-4a14-bf2b-54b86fbcadfd","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// a 被隐式推导为了 any 类型\nlet a;\na = 1;\na = \"s\";","collabId":"3c839ec0-a18e-4b91-abaa-1f0b514070f8","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"e000fc7e-6128-4a4e-a916-f09f26e16835","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"8e7e23a7-1a6d-4efd-9ebe-b64ab0981eaa"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// x 和 y 被隐式推导为 any\nfunction add(x, y) {\n  return x + y;\n}\nadd(1, 2);\nadd(1, \"Hello\");","collabId":"37a9c78f-c86a-41a2-9fa3-b6553943025d","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"aebdc58e-d885-420e-a881-02d022b60b46","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"cb67f036-d314-4355-aef8-983fb045d8db"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// arr 被推导为了 any[]\nconst arr = [];\narr.push('a');\narr.push(1);","collabId":"e33d19bc-f6e8-4fc6-b513-d0cd43d0c023","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"33d3aa4e-f6e1-4ba0-bffe-dfa3a0243036","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"34ce209f-dd63-4b8f-95e7-cd456214215d"},{"children":[{"text":"如果在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"tsconfig.json","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中开启了 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"noImplicitAny","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 选项，那么就会禁止隐式推导为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"any","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，我们必须为变量标注类型，否则编译时就会报错。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"65e6295d-fa9a-4c17-b477-8a82a583f42b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"unknown","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示未知的类型，可以将任意值赋值给该类型的变量，但是使用该变量时，一定要断言为具体的类型才可以使用","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"19db3e86-fea9-4d83-a652-a8b3309d68d2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const a: unknown = 1;\n// ❎\nconst b: number = a;\n// ✅\nconst b: number = a as number;","collabId":"1117ca53-54e2-4014-ad19-ab8427bebff3","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"75a60bfe-1a1d-4810-b704-ec62f615afe3","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b9e3955e-a5cf-4e17-b582-1dbbbed21f2b"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"never","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示一个不存在的类型。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"343ba414-5534-45d0-ab99-c2caba661d77","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// 这个函数不会返回任何内容，\nfunction(): never {\n  throw new Error();\n}","collabId":"9ebd3dc8-849f-470e-a3d9-f2044146d419","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"404f5977-7297-47ee-acac-ad3eeaf55136","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"6c14d159-81b3-4411-a09a-2efad7874f12"},{"children":[{"text":"只有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"never","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 类型的变量能赋值给 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"never","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"any","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 也不行，我们可以利用这一点来做编译时的检查。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"93175ff3-abc7-48bb-ab7a-007c55993fe1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"假设审核结果存在两种状态，过和不过，对于过和不过分别有相应的处理分支：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d01e48ce-bbba-4dbf-973a-01769b2038b6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// 0 表示过，1 表示不过\ntype Status = 0 | 1;\nlet status: Status;\n\nif (status === 0) {\n\n} else if (status === 1) {\n\n} else {\n  throw new Error('不存在的 status 值')\n}","collabId":"742b5ca7-b788-429d-b00c-fb2b792221f2","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"671d316c-d90d-4389-bfdf-27e2e7e51a60","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"d455093b-5f24-48ab-bf92-3eae5cc75da5"},{"children":[{"text":"假设增加了一种状态，表示审核中，修改了类型的标注，但是忘记添加相应的处理分支，此时编译是可以通过的","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"695c22a7-e269-4c73-954b-d2c87171a0f3","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// 0 表示过，1 表示不过，2 表示审核中\ntype Status = 0 | 1 | 2;\nlet status: Status;\n\nif (status === 0) {\n\n} else if (status === 1) {\n\n} else {\n  throw new Error('不存在的 status 值')\n}\n","collabId":"a52e8f4f-113b-440f-9be7-3abe39710dd7","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"fc6a2ee8-f1ac-4401-9f3d-ba75148224d9","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"39a4cc10-5d9f-4732-9e11-319028264f4c"},{"children":[{"text":"只有当程序运行起来时我们才知道忘记处理审核中的状态了，如何在编译时保证我们处理了所有可能的情况呢，那就是在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"else","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中声明一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"never","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 类型的变量","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"aad4ba04-877a-4a5a-9b93-b68a6d510bc7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"if (status === 0) {\n\n} else if (status === 1) {\n\n} else {\n  const _notExist: nerver = status;\n  throw new Error('不存在的 status 值')\n}","collabId":"ec2b53ac-d4e1-4394-b4d2-3e3368b79c96","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"37bcf876-5f7e-464d-821f-1cf6b0456416","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b761e3e2-bc3a-42a2-ae98-7963030b9e59"},{"children":[{"text":"如果我们已经处理了所有的分支，那么到 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"else","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 分支中，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"status","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 已经被收缩到了 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"never","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 类型，此时赋值便不会报错，但是如果我们没有处理所有可能的情况，那么 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"status","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的类型就不是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"never","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，因为只有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"never","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 类型的变量能赋值给","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"never","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的变量，此时编译就会报错。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6eb492b2-218f-4a1a-a38c-f16a1b833506","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"当开启了  ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"noImplicitAny","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 选项，如果不给数组标注类型，数组默认是","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"never[]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 类型，此时我们不能像其中添加其它类型的内容，否则会报错","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"075a0fc8-cbc6-4718-acf3-8a1e054d95ab","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// arr: never[];\nconst arr = [];\n// ❎\narr.push(1);","collabId":"977b494f-852f-457f-81d3-63782b564ce3","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"6875be23-a385-47af-ac3b-8a821ea7fdce","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"66aa2fa9-35bd-4945-87ce-4dd7d07d5418"},{"children":[{"text":"在工作经常看到不为数组标注类型的代码，导致一片飘红，这个还是要注意一下的。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7d8379f6-598f-4bf0-8e82-f4305dc56e26","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":["TypeScript/数据类型"],"createTime":1688913050267,"updateTime":1793532514771,"linkedCards":[{"id":142,"target":{"key":"card:142","type":"card","id":142},"summary":"一个值可能同时具有多种可能的类型，在断言为具体的类型之前只能使用公共的属性和方法 const strOrNum: string | number = \"a\"; // ❎ strOrNum.toLowerCase(); // ✅ (strOr...","tags":["TypeScript/类型守卫"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532514771}}